# eOn SVN r2549. HarnessCounter through ext_pot. Kernel morse_pt.
# Plain NEB. Same settings as eon-svn/de-pt-ci with climbing_image_method false. The run swaps the potential for ext_pot. The harness kernel is r2549 Morse::force: cutoff 9.5, pair energy shifted to zero at the cutoff, minimum image on the box diagonal. The 2014 table used r2156. The binary is SVN r2549, the registry pin. Export of the 2014 revision is forbidden, so this row is r2549.
# Each start is the mean of 2 replicates (svn-all and fortran). n is the number of distinct starts. 0 starts differ in force_calls. Success agrees on every start.
counter harness
code Eon svn
code_version r2549
commit r2549
algorithm LBFGS
tuning default
template eon-svn/de-pt-neb
problem double-ended-saddle-search/pt-island
reducer harness
cap 3000
n 59
